DISCUSSION
I'll write a script to extract the low bitplanes of the shifted bytes as packed bytes and ask `file` about them; sometimes hidden data is stored in one bitplane.
COMMAND
edit 1:1
data = open("blob.bin", "rb").read()
shr = [b >> 1 for b in data]

for bit in range(8):
    bits = [(x >> bit) & 1 for x in shr]
    out = bytearray()
    for i in range(0, len(bits) - 7, 8):
        v = 0
        for j in range(8):
            v = (v << 1) | bits[i + j]
        out.append(v)
    open(f"plane{bit}.bin", "wb").write(out)
    print(bit, len(out))
end_of_edit
